side.com/2026/08/06/3</guid><pubDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 08:03:00 -0400</pubDate></item><item><title>The Far Side - 2026-08-06 #3</title><link>https://www.thefarside.com/2026/08/06/2</link><description>&lt;div style="text-align: center; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto;"&gt;&lt;img src="https://comiccaster.xyz/.netlify/functions/proxy-farside-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffeatureassets.amuniversal.com%2Fassets%2F37a4cca0e3af0137cd49005056a9545d" alt="The Far Side comic" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto;"/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 10px; font-style: italic;"&gt;Crossing paths on their respective journeys of destiny, Johnny Appleseed and Irving Ragweed nod “hello.”&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 15px; font-size: 0.9em;"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.thefarside.com/"&gt;Visit The Far Side&lt;/a&gt; | © Gary Larson&lt;/p&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.thefarside.com/2026/08/06/2</guid><pubDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 08:02:00 -0400</pubDate></item><item><title>The Far Side - 2026-08-06 #2</title><link>https://www.thefarside.com/2026/08/06/1</link><description>&lt;div style="text-align: center; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto;"&gt;&lt;img src="https://comiccaster.xyz/.netlify/functions/proxy-farside-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffeatureassets.amuniversal.com%2Fassets%2F95b01b6158c311ea8bf6005056a9" alt="The Far Side comic" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto;"/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 10px; font-style: italic;"&gt;“Bob, do you think I’m sinking? ... Be
